  | 2 => ⟨(204 : ℤ), (245113983028199061976258550286008675748493788254045526605357 : ℤ), (1015761269048187987336065037038308384722223876048884372193419 : ℤ)⟩

theorem V_mem : V.mem (fTop c) := by
